 end="00:41.619">Just </span><span begin="00:41.619" end="00:42.138">tryna </span><span begin="00:42.138" end="00:43.028">avoid </span><span begin="00:43.028" end="00:43.442">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.442" end="00:45.916"><span begin="00:43.442" end="00:43.725">And </span><span begin="00:43.725" end="00:44.486">hidin' </span><span begin="00:44.486" end="00:44.724">the </span><span begin="00:44.724" end="00:45.624">truth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.916" end="00:48.220"><span begin="00:45.916" end="00:46.132">See </span><span begin="00:46.132" end="00:46.348">you </span><span begin="00:46.348" end="00:46.632">would </span><span begin="00:46.632" end="00:46.916">rather </span><span begin="00:46.916" end="00:47.165">run </span><span begin="00:47.165" end="00:47.492">away </span><span begin="00:47.492" end="00:47.876">from </span><span begin="00:47.876" end="00:48.220">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.220" end="00:50.917"><span begin="00:48.220" end="00:48.556">I </span><span begin="00:48.556" end="00:48.724">just </span><span begin="00:48.724" end="00:49.004">wanted </span><span begin="00:49.004" end="00:49.300">you </span><span begin="00:49.300" end="00:49.461">to </span><span begin="00:49.461" end="00:49.764">say </span><span begin="00:49.764" end="00:50.412">something</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.917" end="00:54.680"><span begin="00:50.917" end="00:51.276">Still </span><span begin="00:51.276" end="00:51.700">can't </span><span begin="00:51.700" end="00:52.500">believe </span><span begin="00:52.676" end="00:52.908">you'd </span><span begin="00:52.908" end="00:53.337">do </span><span begin="00:53.337" end="00:54.216">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.680" end="00:56.560"><span begin="00:54.680" end="00:55.160">Like </span><span begin="00:55.160" end="00:56.368">this</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.560" end="00:59.040"><span begin="00:56.560" end="00:56.792">How </span><span begin="00:56.792" end="00:57.057">could </span><span begin="00:57.057" end="00:57.416">you </span><span begin="00:57.416" end="00:57.880">take </span><span begin="00:57.880" end="00:58.216">him </span><span begin="00:58.216" end="00:58.793">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.040" end="01:04.839"><span begin="00:59.040" end="00:59.408">All </span><span begin="00:59.408" end="00:59.683">the </span><span begin="00:59.683" end="01:00.328">places </span><span begin="01:00.616" end="01:00.920">I </span><span begin="01:00.920" end="01:01.273">used </span><span begin="01:01.273" end="01:01.617">to </span><span begin="01:01.617" end="01:01.929">take </span><span begin="01:01.929" end="01:02.999">you </span><span begin="01:02.999" end="01:04.311">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.839" end="01:08.224"><span begin="01:04.839" end="01:05.319">I </span><span begin="01:05.319" end="01:05.695">thought </span><span begin="01:05.695" end="01:06.129">you </span><span begin="01:06.129" end="01:06.503">were </span><span begin="01:06.503" end="01:07.295">someone </span><span begin="01:07.295" end="01:07.879">else</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.224" end="01:15.519"><span begin="01:08.224" end="01:08.471">Instead </span><span begin="01:08.471" end="01:09.074">you </span><span begin="01:09.074" end="01:09.480">leave </span><span begin="01:09.480" end="01:09.903">me </span><span begin="01:09.903" end="01:10.657">hanging </span><span begin="01:10.657" end="01:12.007">alone </span><span begin="01:12.280" end="01:12.879">by </span><span begin="01:12.879" end="01:14.759">myself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.519" end="01:36.365"><span begin="01:15.519" end="01:15.777">I </span><span begin="01:15.777" end="01:16.064">never </span><span begin="01:16.064" end="01:16.336">thought </span><span begin="01:16.336" end="01:16.544">I'd </span><span begin="01:16.544" end="01:16.761">see </span><span begin="01:16.761" end="01:16.961">the </span><span begin="01:16.961" end="01:17.184">day </span><span begin="01:17.184" end="01:17.384">that </span><span begin="01:17.384" end="01:17.593">you'd </span><span begin="01:17.593" end="01:17.792">be </span><span begin="01:17.792" end="01:18.096">so </span><span begin="01:18.096" end="01:19.216">cruel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.365" end="01:37.397"><span begin="01:36.365" end="01:36.621">Why </span><span begin="01:36.621" end="01:36.916">you </span><span begin="01:36.916" end="01:37.092">playin' </span><span begin="01:37.092" end="01:37.397">games</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.397" end="01:38.460"><span begin="01:37.397" end="01:37.653">Wish </span><span begin="01:37.653" end="01:37.788">it </span><span begin="01:37.788" end="01:37.980">was </span><span begin="01:37.980" end="01:38.155">the </span><span begin="01:38.155" end="01:38.460">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.460" end="01:44.955"><span begin="01:38.460" end="01:38.901">Probably </span><span begin="01:38.901" end="01:39.140">never </span><span begin="01:39.140" end="01:39.500">gonna </span><span begin="01:39.500" end="01:40.110">be </span><span begin="01:40.110" end="01:40.498">what </span><span begin="01:40.498" end="01:40.730">it </span><span begin="01:40.730" end="01:41.818">used </span><span begin="01:41.818" end="01:43.012">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.955" end="01:46.468"><span begin="01:44.955" end="01:45.444">But </span><span begin="01:45.444" end="01:45.606">I </span><span begin="01:45.606" end="01:45.766">am </span><span begin="01:45.766" end="01:45.980">gonna </span><span begin="01:45.980" end="01:46.468">stress</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.468" end="01:47.732"><span begin="01:46.468" end="01:46.740">When </span><span begin="01:46.740" end="01:46.916">there's </span><span begin="01:46.916" end="01:47.156">nothin' </span><span begin="01:47.156" end="01:47.548">left</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.732" end="01:52.637"><span begin="01:47.732" end="01:48.029">You </span><spa